{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build scaffolding, piping and lighting to increase your odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/extras/Build34-16.gif?t=1745254795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use the Right Tool For the Job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use gadgets to brave the depths. Be careful, they can be dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/extras/Tools314-18.gif?t=1745254795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trade For Supplies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your reputation up to buy tools for your dig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/extras/Buy334-16.png?t=1745254795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Time Passes When You Die</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no checkpoints in The Last Dig, only new explorers to find your buried corpse years later. Will you find your treasure before Earth is sealed off forever?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/extras/Wreckage334-16.gif?t=1745254795\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Earn Paint Jobs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change up your paint job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/extras/ColorChange14-18.gif?t=1745254795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Riches From the Deep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich reward awaits those daring enough to dig. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards\u2014and the risks. Anything could be down there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/extras/Digging34-16.gif?t=1745254795\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3205800?t=1745254795","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745254795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/87bcffd2debd1f7141f58586baf74b55700eaf39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745254795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/87bcffd2debd1f7141f58586baf74b55700eaf39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745254795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build scaffolding, piping and lighting to increase your odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/extras/Build34-16.gif?t=1745254795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use the Right Tool For the Job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use gadgets to brave the depths. Be careful, they can be dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/extras/Tools314-18.gif?t=1745254795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trade For Supplies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your reputation up to buy tools for your dig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205800/extras/Buy334-16.png?t=1745254795\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Time Passes When You Die</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no checkpoints in The Last Dig, only new explorers to find your buried corpse years later. Will you find your treasure before 